  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Svensk strategi, Unicef</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Swedish strategy, UNICEF</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Den innevarande strategin f&#xF6;r Sveriges samarbete med Unicef g&#xE4;ller t o m 2005. En ny strategi ska g&#xF6;ras, vilken kommer att g&#xE4;lla  2006-2009, vilket motsvarar den period som g&#xE4;ller f&#xF6;r Unicefs Medium Term Strategic Plan.medel beh&#xF6;vs f&#xF6;r att t&#xE4;cka konsultarvode, m&#xF6;teskostnader m.m.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The present Swedish strategy for cooperation with UNICEF runs out by the end of 2005. A new strategy will be made, and it will cover the period 2006-2009 which corresponds to the period for the Medium Term Strategic Plan of UNICEF to be approved by the Board in September 2005. Funds are needed for consultancy fees and for meeting and print costs.</narrative>
  </description>
